# `cargo llvm-cov` writes its summary where `.github/workflows/coverage.yml`
# reads it and the badge next to it; a local reproduction run writes the same
# two paths, and neither is a file of this repository (the badge CI publishes
# lives on the `badges` branch).
/coverage.json
/badges/
# The workspace lock is committed (that is what CI builds with `--locked`);
# the stale per-example lock files left over from standalone builds are not.
**/Cargo.lock
!/Cargo.lock
.idea
/test_data
/test
/acts/test
/acts.cfg
doc/book/
.claude
docs/
.superpowers/
data/